    "type": "message",
    "user": "U08S0TP9R3P",
    "text": "\u003c@U0BTUQGHDDF\u003e Thanks for the logs. Discovery reads the table list from `INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLES` for the configured database (`POS`) and keeps only entries with `TABLE_TYPE = 'BASE TABLE'`\n\nCould you run this query as the same user and share the output?\n```SELECT TABLE_SCHEMA, TABLE_NAME, TABLE_TYPE, ENGINE\nFROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLES\nWHERE TABLE_NAME = 'payment_response';```",
    "ts": "1794477697.932579",
    "thread_ts": "1794477020.733759",
    "edited": {
      "user": "U08S0TP9R3P",
      "ts": "1794477715.000000"
